// Heron Sedan body: an early-2000s mid-size family sedan.
//
// Intent: taller and squarer-shouldered than the jellybeans it replaced. A blunt rounded
// nose with swept lamps and a thin bright slot, a long raked windshield, a tall arched
// roof, a high short deck, a strong straight beltline, wrapped tail lamps, plain
// body-colored bumpers and five-spoke alloys. Mostly silver. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
